; Lili, sketch C "Wonky Circus": C minor, 110 bpm, shuffle. A clarinet sways through a lopsided swung hook over a walking pluck bass, offbeat plucked-guitar dyads and a held string line; clap-and-hat shuffle. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
